# fixture for MTL material fidelity (#1575)
# `alpha` carries specular AND an opacity map; `beta` carries a specular
# colour with a ZERO exponent (what an exporter writes for a matte surface,
# and the case that must NOT turn the highlight on); `gamma` carries an
# exponent with no colour; `plain` carries neither.
newmtl alpha
Kd 1.0 0.2 0.2
Ks 0.8 0.9 1.0
Ns 64
map_Kd multitex-a.png
map_d multitex-alpha.png

newmtl beta
Kd 0.2 1.0 0.2
Ks 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ns 0

newmtl gamma
Kd 0.2 0.2 1.0
Ns 200

newmtl plain
Kd 0.9 0.9 0.9
